OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor John Healey in Commons
OL,4,Ato deliver his first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealey announced standing charges are
OL,7,Fto be scrapped from household gas bills
OL,9,FThe move - due to take effect next year
OL,10,F"or as soon as possible" - will save
OL,11,F60% of households an average of #45 per
OL,12,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,14,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,15,F"moves money and power out of
OL,16,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,17,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,18,Fgovernment borrowing
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
